Usage: agent-deck creds-refresh [options]

Keep Claude OAuth credentials refreshed for configured profiles.

Options:
  -config-dir value
    	profile config dir to keep warm (repeatable); defaults to ~/.claude, ~/.claude-work and every config_dir declared in config.toml
  -endpoint string
    	OAuth token endpoint (override for testing only) (default "https://platform.claude.com/v1/oauth/token")
  -interval duration
    	refresh cadence when running as a daemon (default 25m0s)
  -once
    	run a single refresh pass and exit (cron-friendly)
  -threshold duration
    	refresh when the access token expires within this window (default 20m0s)
